ween kingship, state power, and Vaişnava observance. [...] Within this well-established sectarian context, Vaişnava devotion appears to have enjoyed the preponderance of royal Funanese patronage.” '}], {'usage.total_tokens': 871, 'usage.prompt_tokens': 782})
