ries’ fascination with the magico-religious aspects of Buddhism. However this did not diminish his great contribution to the transformation of Buddhism from a uji-centered religion to a court-sponsored national religion.” '}], {'usage.total_tokens': 864, 'usage.prompt_tokens': 820})
