tinued to rely on the Church to support and legitimise their rule. They were all consecrated at Reims, and they persisted in claiming the right to appoint bishops in diceses both within and outside the royal principality." '}], {'usage.total_tokens': 856, 'usage.prompt_tokens': 766})
